<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 6,940 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 1,200 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  137   (150 and 242)</p>
<p>    Good		128   (130 and 160)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     120   (118 and 126)</p>
<p>    Medium	    112   (112 and  92)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 90   ( 98 and  80)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 137 pence for a Sri Lanka BOPF.</p>
</text>
